# "If you would draw a card, draw two cards instead" is cumulative with Thought Reflection's (its ruling; CR 614.5, 616.1): each
# replacement effect gets one opportunity at the draw and at the draws that replace it, so at max speed the draw step's one draw
# is four cards (Thought Reflection's two, each made two by Vnwxt, or the other way round), no more and no fewer. Bot1 reaches
# speed 4 with Lightning Bolts on turns 1, 3 and 5; its turn 7 draw step is Vnwxt's alone (two cards: Thought Reflection and an
# Island), and Thought Reflection is cast that turn with Black Lotus, Mox Sapphire, Mox Ruby and its two Mountains, so the draw
# step of turn 9 draws four: a Forest, a Plains, a Swamp and a Mountain.

